<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>SDS Password Reset Code</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #1f2937;
      background-color: #f5f7fb;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 24px 0;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 560px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid #dbe4ee;
      border-radius: 12px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .header {
      background-color: #0f2a58;
      color: #ffffff;
      padding: 20px 24px;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 20px;
    }
    .content {
      padding: 24px;
    }
    .code-wrap {
      margin: 20px 0;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .code {
      display: inline-block;
      font-family: "Courier New", monospace;
      font-size: 30px;
      letter-spacing: 8px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #0f2a58;
      background: #eef5ff;
      border: 1px solid #b7cff0;
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 12px 18px;
    }
    .note {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #4b5563;
      margin-top: 8px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .footer {
      border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
      padding: 14px 24px;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #6b7280;
      text-align: center;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">Reset Your SDS Password</div>
    <div class="content">
      <p>Hello {{firstName}},</p>
      <p>Use this one-time code to reset your SDS account password:</p>

      <div class="code-wrap">
        <span class="code">{{verificationCode}}</span>
        <p class="note">This code expires in {{otpExpiresMinutes}} minutes.</p>
      </div>

      <p>If you did not request a password reset, you can ignore this email.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      &copy; 2026 Ministry of Labour and Social Security - Kingdom of Eswatini
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
